----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERDICT
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  R_E failure at Salpeter, a0=1.132e-10 : 5.37 sigma (A55 4.9)
  M/L that zeroes it                   : 1.193 x Salpeter (A55 quoted 1.283)
  same, in the direct SLACS IMF units  : 2.13 sigma from the measured mean
  kappa* with Salpeter fixed           : 1.168 (A51 band 0.252-0.490)
  kappa* with the IMF free             : unconstrained, Delta-chi2 < 0.2 over 0.2-0.8
  shape at fixed amplitude             : gamma_pred - gamma_obs = +0.277 +- 0.040

